# App-authored briefing, not from a tape. Grounded only in the public label in
# levels.json and the unverified secondary overview. No tape or manual in the
# library describes Focus 49. Beyond-galaxy, I-There cluster and Cluster Council
# language is presented as a map to test, never as expected scale or company.

@segment     briefing-f49
@title       Focus 49 — Sea of I-There Clusters
@levels      F49
@verbosity   2
@protected   Focus 49, I-There, Cluster Council
@duration    ~1m

say You are now in Focus 49.
pause 5
say No tape or manual in this library describes this level. The available map is a secondary overview of uncertain origin, so hold its description lightly.
pause 6
say That overview associates Focus 49 with exploration beyond our galaxy, I-There clusters, and what it calls the Cluster Council.
pause 8
say Treat those as coordinates to test, not a scale, structure, or presence you are required to perceive.
pause 6
say Observe what is actually present for you, including any absence, without forcing it to match the map.
pause 12
say Remember what you notice. Your attributed account may confirm, amend, or reject the available description.
pause 10
